To Hee tidak akan berhasil keluar tanpa cedera.

532
00:44:37.800 --> 00:44:38.842
Terima kasih.

533
00:44:40.135 --> 00:44:41.136
Dan…

534
00:44:42.930 --> 00:44:44.473
aku minta maaf

535
00:44:45.307 --> 00:44:47.017
